n reliability, crew atmosphere, decision quality, etc. Provide evidence: 100% reliability, positive crew atmosphere, quick correct decisions, calm in crisis, excellent attention. Also note concerns but still best.\n\nThen metadata JSON with vote Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
